": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "pppppppppppppppppppWWWWWWWWWWW\nlen leading p 19", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "THINKING", "content": "Now 19 p. So each left+ACTION7 adds 1 p. We need to fill the entire bar; likely length maybe 64? The bottom row seems to have many whites after p's. Let's check total width.", "kind": "reasoning", "inContext": false}, {"label": "TOOL CALL: python", "content": "<tool_call>\n<function=python>\n<parameter=code>\nrow = current_frame.ascii.split('\\n')[-1]\nprint('total length', len(row))\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "total length 64", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "THINKING", "content": "So we need 64 p's to fill entire row. Currently 19 p. Need 45 more. Each left+ACTION7 adds 1 p, so need 45 more cycles. That's many actions. But maybe there is faster way: maybe pressing ACTION7 repeatedly without moving left also adds p? Let's test: press ACTION7 again without moving left.", "kind": "reasoning", "inContext": false}, {"label": "TOOL CALL: python", "content": "<tool_call>\n<function=python>\n<parameter=code>\naction(['ACTION7'], intent='solve')\n</parameter>\n</function>\n</tool_call>", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}, {"label": "TOOL RESULT: python", "content": "executed: true\naction_num: 20\nlevel: 1\nscore: 0\nreward: 0.0\nstate: NOT_FINISHED\nvalid_actions:\n  - LEFT\n  - RIGHT\n  - MOUSE\n  - ACTION7\nboard_changed: true\ngameplay_changed: true\nno_impact: false\ndone: false\nlevel_completed: false\ngame_over: false\naction_display: ACTION7\nexecuted_actions:\n  -\n    action: ACTION7\n    animation:\n      num_frames: 2\n      changed: true\n      only_changed: false\n      total_cells_changed: 47\n      cells_changed_per_frame: [47, 0]\n      objects:\n        []\nhud_band: rows 63-63\nno_impact_source: band\nstate_node_id: 5\ngraph_nodes: 10\nuntried_here:\n  - MOUSE\n  - ACTION7\nrevisited_state: true\nrun_elapsed_seconds: 230.610205135\ntime_remaining_seconds: 7689.389794865", "kind": "tool", "inContext": true}], "hasExactModelContext": false, "requestIndexWithinTurn": null, "messageCount": 0}}}